# Responsive Landing Page

## Project Description
This is a responsive landing page created using HTML and Tailwind CSS. It includes a sticky navigation bar, hero section, floating cards, and a fixed chat button. The layout is fully responsive for desktop and mobile devices.

## Features
- Responsive Design
- Sticky Navbar
- Hero Section
- Floating Cards
- Fixed Chat Button
- Tailwind CSS Styling

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- Tailwind CSS

## Folder Structure
```
project/
│── index.html
│── README.md
```

## How to Run
1. Download or clone the project.
2. Open `index.html` in any web browser.
3. Ensure an internet connection is available because Tailwind CSS is loaded using CDN.

